Cell["2. The composite rule", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"24cedb7d-38fc-7141-a4d8-152a09c0b9fd"],

Cell["\<\
By the concurrency theorem the whole trace is one rule, from the input \
interface to the output interface. For the causal tracelet, an edge becomes a \
path of three:\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"b284943c-ddd9-9e49-96b3-edafb28c4f6a"],

