essionUUID->"2888fefa-6b56-4745-99e6-7dd03191f09e"],

Cell["\<\
\"Input\" and \"Output\" are the two interfaces; \"Composite\" is the single \
rule they make; \"Trace\" is the derivation in minimal context, which is what \
\"Diagram\" draws; \"Overlaps\" are the tokens gluing step to step; \
\"CausalOrder\" and \"Linearisations\" are what they amount to; \
\"Multiplicity\" and \"Occurrences\" say how often this tracelet turned up \
and where.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"7e33675d-000f-f242-9cb0-d7e7d53c19fb"],

Cell["Other ways to ask. A single explicit trace, by event number:", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"77387b86-ba87-384b-b6e5-b4ede647245e"],

